source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A `&#46;` keeps the control off a list item's content start as it does off any other line start, so the item keeps its text.
-- input.jira --
* h1&#46; y
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>h1&#46; y</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- h1&#46; y
-- warnings.json --
[]
